WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:07.620
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, and since there
have been so many questions about what’s

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.190
going to be happening this fall in terms of
videos and stuff I’m doing, I wanted to

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:12.790
do a trailer video explaining my updated video
schedule.

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:16.150
This will cover everything between September
right now and December.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:18.570
Including shows, movies and even the video
game channel.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:23.410
Some of you might know about my not so secret
video game channel charliestreams.

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.939
There is so much awesome stuff coming you
have no idea how excited I am.

00:00:26.939 --> 00:00:30.689
If you’re just finding me for the first
time.

00:00:30.689 --> 00:00:32.910
My name is Charlie and I like Fiction.

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:36.670
There’s also some really important business
that I’ve woefully neglected.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:43.789
We are almost at 400,000 subscribers here
and first of all thank you for being amazing.

00:00:43.789 --> 00:00:46.350
But we need to think of a name for ourselves.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.890
Right now I’m thinking The Legion sounds
really nice.

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:52.210
But while I explain the plan start thinking
of names.

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:57.480
Here we go, I’m just going to do tv shows
first by which day of the week they’ll be

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:58.480
on.

00:00:58.480 --> 00:00:59.480
Starting with Mondays.

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:01.880
This is going to be Gotham and Star Wars Rebels.

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:04.460
Gotham is the Batman Prequel show on FOX.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:08.030
It starts September 22nd at 8PM Eastern Time.

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:11.560
All the time slots I’m going to mention
will be in Eastern Time, so just adjust based

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:12.850
on which time zone you live in.

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:18.270
It’s going to be told from the perspective
of Detective Gordon, played by Ben MacKenzie.

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:22.280
The number 1 reason you need to watch this
is because it is going to feature almost every

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:25.200
Batman villain you can think of.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:28.880
Hugo Strange and Arkham Asylum will be heavily
featured.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:33.659
And there’s this great running gag where
supposedly the main villain owns a comedy

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:35.340
club, and a new “Comedian” auditions in
every episode.

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:40.310
Just as a funny way to tease who they’ll
cast as The Joker.

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:44.590
Even the super haters in the blogosphere that
have seen the first episode were blown away.

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:49.360
Tonally it’s going to feel more like a really
dark cop drama with superheroes in it.

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:53.659
Donal Logue, who’s playing Bullock is going
to be so much fun to watch.

00:01:53.659 --> 00:01:58.979
Next is Star Wars Rebels, Disney bought Lucasfilm,
so this is going to air on Disney XD starting

00:01:58.979 --> 00:02:03.189
October 13th at 9PM, so see, things are already
working out.

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:06.100
You can watch Gotham first and Rebels right
after.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:10.060
The number one reason you need to watch Rebels
is because right now is the beginning of this

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:14.500
unprecedented thing in the Star Wars Universe,
where all of the movies, the tv shows, the

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.860
novels and the comics exist in a shared universe.

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:22.571
Star Wars under Disney’s watchful eye, is
doing the same thing Marvel is where things

00:02:22.571 --> 00:02:26.510
happening on the tv shows affect what’s
happening in the movies and vice versa.

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:30.390
Since Rebels is a prequel show about the time
between Episode 3 and Episode 4.

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:34.550
It will give a lot of the background about
what’s going on when Episode 7 picks up.

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:38.970
They are making slight modifications to the
original film canon.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:41.350
And Rebels will explain it all.

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:44.110
Moving on to Tuesdays:

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:48.960
Agents of SHIELD, The Flash and Supernatural
are all the Tuesday shows.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:53.670
Agents of SHIELD and Supernatural air at the
same time, so I’ll explain how I’m going

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:57.310
to fix that problem.

00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:01.250
Agents of SHIELD is the first thing to premiere,
it’s coming September 23rd at 9PM on ABC.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:05.680
They already confirmed that Hayley Atwell
will be in the first episode as her Agent

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:07.410
Carter character.

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:08.410
Probably in a flashback.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:12.930
But the number one reason you need to watch
this is all the new Marvel characters they’re

00:03:12.930 --> 00:03:17.610
rolling out and the overlap with the Avengers
Age of Ultron movie.

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:22.790
Next is The Flash with Grant Gustin, that
premieres October 7th at 8PM on the CW.

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:25.370
I’ve already been doing a lot of bonus videos
for this.

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:29.350
The number one reason you need to watch it
is because it is also the beginning of an

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:34.580
unprecedented time in DC Comics television
where characters from each of their four shows

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:36.810
get to overlap.

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:37.810
The Flash will mostly bounce back and forth
with Arrow characters.

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:38.810
Characters from both shows will guest star
in each other’s stories.

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:40.040
The mid season finale of Arrow and The Flash
will be a two hour crossover event.

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:41.040
Seriously, it’s going to be freaking amazing.

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:42.040
Your faces will melt off.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:43.870
They’ve got a huge list of comic book characters
they’ve already cast including Firestorm

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:47.360
and a bunch of people from Prison Break.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:48.950
Moving on to Supernatural Season 10.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:53.970
It’s premiering right after the first episode
of The Flash at 9PM also on the CW.

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:56.520
This overlaps with Agents of SHIELD.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:04:00.910
So what I’m probably going to do is I’ll
still post a video for the premiere.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:03.600
But I might just do Supernatural videos in
some other way.

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:05.660
Probably as a blog post or something on tumblr.

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:11.010
For those that don’t know, I do have a website
called EmergencyAwesome.com, I just haven’t

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:12.080
posted anything new there in a year.

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:15.120
So I might use that do funny Supernatural
stuff.

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:18.730
I need to make it look all shiny.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.090
Moving on to Wednesdays:

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:22.680
This will be Arrow day.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:27.870
That premieres the same week as the Flash
on October 8th at 8PM on the CW.

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:32.690
I did videos for all of season 2 and everyone
loved it, so if you’re new to the show and

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:34.230
you haven’t been watching it.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:38.620
The number one reason you need to is they
are basically doing Justice League on TV way

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:40.729
before the movies ever get there.

00:04:40.729 --> 00:04:45.540
Even just between Arrow and The Flash, we
get a one hour Justice League episode every

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:47.010
single week.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:53.780
I don’t have any videos planned for Thursday
shows right now, so that will be a catch up

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:56.820
